# Shell scripts must be LF: piping to sh on Linux breaks on CRLF, and the
# installer is fetched with `curl … | sh`.
#
# UNANCHORED on purpose. This used to read `scripts/*.sh`, which contains a
# slash and is therefore anchored to this file's directory — so moving the
# scripts into app_qt/ would have silently stopped matching them, and the
# installer would have started shipping CRLF with no error anywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
